10:T82a,<p>Install Reviewkit in a minute, straight from the WordPress plugin directory. Pick whichever way suits you.</p>
<h2>Modern Way</h2>
<h3>Search on WordPress.org</h3>
<p>Go to your <strong>WordPress Dashboard → Plugins → Add Plugin</strong> page. Click on the <strong>Add Plugin</strong> button, then search &quot;reviewkit&quot;.</p>
<p><img src="https://reviewkit-data.gutensuite.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/image-4-1024x576.png" alt="Searching for reviewkit on the Add Plugin screen" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></p>
<h3>Activate the plugin</h3>
<p>Go to the <strong>Installed Plugins</strong> page and activate the plugin.</p>
<p><img src="https://reviewkit-data.gutensuite.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/image-3-1024x66.png" alt="Activating Reviewkit on the Installed Plugins screen" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></p>
<p>That&#39;s how simple it is.</p>
<h2>Old Way</h2>
<h3>Search on WordPress.org</h3>
<p>Simply search <strong>&quot;Reviewkit Trustpilot&quot;</strong> on the WordPress.org <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/">plugin directory</a> and find the following plugin.</p>
<p><img src="https://reviewkit-data.gutensuite.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/image-1024x454.png" alt="Reviewkit Trustpilot listed on WordPress.org" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></p>
<h3>Download the plugin</h3>
<p><img src="https://reviewkit-data.gutensuite.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/image-1-1024x488.png" alt="Downloading the Reviewkit plugin" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></p>
<h3>Upload the plugin on your website</h3>
<p>Go to your <strong>WordPress Dashboard → Plugins → Add Plugin</strong>. Click on the <strong>Upload</strong> button and upload the downloaded Reviewkit plugin.</p>
<p><img src="https://reviewkit-data.gutensuite.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/image-2-1024x279.png" alt="Uploading the Reviewkit plugin zip" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></p>
<h3>Activate the plugin</h3>
<p>Go to the <strong>Installed Plugins</strong> page and activate the plugin.</p>
<p>That&#39;s it. Your Trustpilot reviews are now one Sync Reviews click away.</p>
